WEBVTT

01:43.560 --> 01:43.960
There you go.

01:44.880 --> 01:45.440
A hundred and fifty.

01:46.920 --> 01:47.759
Nice job.

01:49.440 --> 01:49.960
Go ahead, scan it.

01:57.600 --> 01:58.360
You crazy or something?

01:58.600 --> 01:59.360
I'll pay you

01:59.360 --> 02:00.440
to talk Qing Ye

02:00.880 --> 02:01.760
into going abroad.

02:05.440 --> 02:06.760
If you've got money to burn,

02:06.880 --> 02:08.120
go sponsor some poor kids.

02:13.840 --> 02:14.640
Quite a temper.

02:31.400 --> 02:32.840
Nobody ever does something for someone

02:32.840 --> 02:33.600
for no reason,

02:33.600 --> 02:34.640
or expects nothing back.

02:35.640 --> 02:36.760
If someone's willing to be good to you,

02:36.760 --> 02:37.760
there's always a reason.

02:52.920 --> 02:53.640
Hey, Kyle.

02:54.840 --> 02:56.360
You asleep? Come out.

02:58.160 --> 02:58.840
[Nah, nah.]

02:58.880 --> 03:00.520
[Got work tomorrow, so I can't hang.]

03:00.640 --> 03:01.800
[You get some sleep too, man.]

03:07.960 --> 03:08.720
Hey, Big G.

03:09.360 --> 03:09.960
You asleep?

03:10.640 --> 03:11.320
Wanna come out?

03:12.360 --> 03:14.240
[We're working with Kyle tomorrow.]

03:15.040 --> 03:16.160
[Meet at four tomorrow morning.]

03:16.160 --> 03:17.720
[Don't forget.]

03:55.520 --> 03:56.040
Nah.

03:59.240 --> 04:00.480
It's barely past four.

04:00.480 --> 04:01.480
What are you guys doing here?

04:02.360 --> 04:03.440
It's already getting light out.

04:03.680 --> 04:04.560
At this hour,

04:04.680 --> 04:06.200
what are you doing in Wu's room?

04:06.600 --> 04:08.280
Sleeping, of course.

04:10.600 --> 04:11.960
Something came up last night.

04:13.080 --> 04:14.440
Had nowhere to go, so I crashed here.

04:15.480 --> 04:16.240
It's a party in here.

04:17.519 --> 04:19.279
You really have a thing for picking up strays, huh?

04:20.279 --> 04:21.320
A cousin is ok.

04:21.320 --> 04:22.000
But what's this supposed to mean?

04:22.320 --> 04:22.800
Your dad,

04:23.000 --> 04:24.040
isn't he shorthanded for hauling?

04:24.800 --> 04:25.640
Wanna be a grunt?

04:25.680 --> 04:27.080
That wasn't on my schedule.

04:27.160 --> 04:28.640
You don't get to crash at Xuan Island for free.

04:30.080 --> 04:31.240
Didn't I already pay?

04:31.360 --> 04:32.120
Around here,

04:32.640 --> 04:34.040
money doesn't solve everything.

04:46.360 --> 04:47.280
What's that smell?

04:47.360 --> 04:48.080
It stinks.

04:49.080 --> 04:50.560
Seafood.

04:50.920 --> 04:51.560
Do you guys normally work

04:51.560 --> 04:52.800
in this kind of environment?

04:53.600 --> 04:54.360
No kidding.

04:54.760 --> 04:55.560
It's just the four of us.

04:56.440 --> 04:57.280
Aren't they people too?

04:58.960 --> 05:00.000
Look at you.

05:00.000 --> 05:01.120
If you can't handle it, don't force it.

05:01.920 --> 05:02.880
Don't judge a book by its cover.

05:04.280 --> 05:05.080
Where do I change?

05:07.440 --> 05:07.880
Go.

05:12.760 --> 05:13.200
Ok.

05:14.280 --> 05:15.760
Hey, be careful.

05:16.080 --> 05:16.640
Don't worry.

05:25.880 --> 05:26.520
Hey,

05:27.120 --> 05:28.680
if you're gonna puke, go do it over there.

05:28.920 --> 05:30.600
This is all seafood. You'll mess it up.

05:36.800 --> 05:38.360
If you can't, don't push it.

05:38.360 --> 05:38.960
I'm fine.

05:42.760 --> 05:43.480
Okay.

05:44.080 --> 05:44.640
Big G.

05:45.440 --> 05:46.080
Catch this for me.

05:46.280 --> 05:46.680
Sure.

05:54.040 --> 05:54.920
If it's too much, just go back.

05:58.320 --> 05:59.000
I'm fine.

05:59.440 --> 06:00.640
I'm used to having seafood

06:00.640 --> 06:01.280
in a restaurant.

06:01.720 --> 06:03.200
This is my first time getting up close.

06:03.200 --> 06:03.920
It's a little overwhelming.

06:05.120 --> 06:05.560
Alright, listen.

06:06.840 --> 06:08.040
Go load the truck over there.

06:08.640 --> 06:09.320
The smell's not as bad over there.

06:10.120 --> 06:10.560
Got it.

06:17.480 --> 06:18.080
Xing Wu?

06:21.040 --> 06:21.600
Ye.

06:22.760 --> 06:23.440
Where are you going?

06:23.760 --> 06:24.360
Going for a run.

06:25.320 --> 06:25.800
Sit down.

06:25.960 --> 06:26.920
Let me talk to you for a sec.

06:30.280 --> 06:30.920
Auntie.

06:31.800 --> 06:33.600
This mask really fits your face shape.

06:33.680 --> 06:34.400
Really?

06:35.120 --> 06:37.040
This is the one you gave me.

06:37.040 --> 06:38.240
What's it called?

06:39.360 --> 06:40.040
Clinique.

06:40.640 --> 06:41.040
Right.

06:41.159 --> 06:42.120
Whatever it is.

06:42.320 --> 06:43.720
So yesterday,

06:43.720 --> 06:45.120
I heard you tell me

06:45.120 --> 06:46.440
that Meng wants to take you abroad.

06:47.560 --> 06:48.960
I didn't sleep a wink

06:49.440 --> 06:50.920
all night.

06:51.040 --> 06:52.480
I mean, as your aunt,

06:52.520 --> 06:53.880
I gotta have a real talk with you.

06:56.159 --> 06:57.560
This thing about going abroad with Meng,

06:57.680 --> 06:59.880
you really need to think it over.

07:00.040 --> 07:02.400
Sometimes, you get a hand of cards,

07:02.520 --> 07:03.600
and you think

07:03.720 --> 07:04.720
you're gonna score big?

07:04.920 --> 07:06.000
But then by the end,

07:06.200 --> 07:07.200
you end up losing big.

07:07.760 --> 07:08.520
You get what I'm saying?

07:09.680 --> 07:11.640
Mahjong really is a national treasure.

07:12.280 --> 07:13.480
So full of life lessons.

07:13.880 --> 07:15.640
Look, I've been there before.

07:15.800 --> 07:16.600
Made my share of mistakes.

07:16.760 --> 07:18.240
I don't want you to fall into the same traps.

07:18.560 --> 07:19.240
When it comes to people,

07:19.320 --> 07:20.960
you gotta keep your eyes open.

07:21.040 --> 07:22.680
Especially with men.

07:22.960 --> 07:24.160
You can't just get all hot-headed

07:24.600 --> 07:25.920
and run off with someone.

07:26.560 --> 07:28.000
Auntie, where is this coming from?

07:28.040 --> 07:29.080
It's not running off.

07:29.520 --> 07:31.400
He's taking me abroad to study.

07:31.440 --> 07:32.480
Going abroad to study?

07:32.480 --> 07:34.240
Isn't that just running off?

07:34.360 --> 07:35.560
That's even worse.

07:35.720 --> 07:36.440
I checked

07:36.440 --> 07:38.000
all those interview invitations,

07:38.000 --> 07:39.159
financial proof and everything.

07:39.159 --> 07:39.880
They're all real.

07:40.200 --> 07:41.960
What do his parents think?

07:42.600 --> 07:43.600
Back then,

07:43.960 --> 07:45.400
didn't Wu also make the call on his own

07:45.400 --> 07:46.560
to bring me back from Beijing?

07:46.600 --> 07:47.440
Didn't he tell you?

07:47.800 --> 07:49.240
Can you even compare him to Wu?

07:49.720 --> 07:51.000
Wu is my son.

07:51.240 --> 07:52.680
I raised him.

07:52.680 --> 07:53.920
His character is solid.

07:54.440 --> 07:55.520
Anyway,

07:55.600 --> 07:56.560
before he gets my okay,

07:56.560 --> 07:57.560
you can't just run off with him

07:57.600 --> 07:58.680
without really knowing

07:58.680 --> 07:59.440
what he's like.

08:02.400 --> 08:03.160
Fine.

08:03.720 --> 08:04.280
Whatever you say.

08:05.080 --> 08:05.880
I'm going for my run now.

08:05.920 --> 08:06.360
Okay.

08:09.440 --> 08:10.440
See you when you get back!

08:12.440 --> 08:13.120
Your steamed buns.

08:13.160 --> 08:13.640
Thanks.

08:20.520 --> 08:21.080
Thank you.

08:21.960 --> 08:23.160
You've got nothing left in your stomach, huh?

08:23.840 --> 08:24.400
Eat up.

08:31.680 --> 08:32.960
This place really changes people.

08:33.760 --> 08:34.600
Qing Ye's not the same

08:34.600 --> 08:35.240
as before either.

08:36.520 --> 08:37.320
How so?

08:38.080 --> 08:39.039
Before,

08:39.480 --> 08:40.799
she would've jumped at the chance

08:40.799 --> 08:41.960
to go abroad.

08:42.799 --> 08:44.360
Not waste time here

08:44.800 --> 08:45.640
propping up a barbershop.

08:47.800 --> 08:48.840
I asked her that too.

08:49.760 --> 08:50.840
She doesn't think it's a waste.

08:54.800 --> 08:56.040
Sure, the environment can change a person.

08:56.800 --> 08:57.560
But Qing Ye

08:58.200 --> 08:59.560
also has the power to change it back.

09:01.120 --> 09:01.760
Morning, Ye.

09:01.760 --> 09:02.240
Morning, Auntie.

09:02.520 --> 09:03.160
Have you eaten?

09:03.360 --> 09:04.520
Not yet. I'll eat when I get back.

09:04.680 --> 09:05.240
Save me some, okay?

09:05.240 --> 09:05.640
Sure.

09:05.640 --> 09:06.440
Out for a run?

09:06.440 --> 09:07.240
Morning, Uncle.

09:07.640 --> 09:08.840
[Whatever she sets her mind to,]

09:08.920 --> 09:09.600
Hope business is booming!

09:09.600 --> 09:10.280
[she goes all in,]

09:10.280 --> 09:11.200
[a hundred percent.]

09:11.200 --> 09:12.440
Such a sweet talker.

09:14.040 --> 09:14.600
Hey, Bo.

09:14.840 --> 09:16.240
You should go for a run too.

09:16.280 --> 09:17.280
Lose some weight, eat a little less.

09:17.520 --> 09:18.320
[Before you know it,]

09:18.320 --> 09:19.200
[she draws you in,]

09:19.720 --> 09:20.480
[and you just go along with her.]

09:20.480 --> 09:21.080
Granny Zhang,

09:21.560 --> 09:23.360
these eggplants look really good.

09:24.160 --> 09:25.680
Come pick some when they're ripe.

09:26.400 --> 09:27.080
Going for a run.

09:27.440 --> 09:28.320
Through her light,

09:29.600 --> 09:30.560
you see who you really are.

09:34.200 --> 09:34.840
Look, I admit,

09:36.040 --> 09:37.000
she's having fun

09:37.160 --> 09:37.960
here.

09:38.920 --> 09:39.760
But this is just

09:39.760 --> 09:40.840
a little vacation kick for her.

09:41.680 --> 09:43.840
She belongs to a much bigger world.

09:44.760 --> 09:45.840
If you really care about her,

09:46.400 --> 09:47.360
help me convince her

09:47.480 --> 09:48.240
to come abroad with me.

09:51.080 --> 09:51.920
I'm not her.

09:53.240 --> 09:54.440
I can't just push my own perspective

09:54.640 --> 09:55.520
and interfere with her choices.

09:59.400 --> 10:00.440
What if I told you

10:01.640 --> 10:02.400
that what I'm offering

10:02.400 --> 10:03.720
is exactly the life she wants?

10:12.800 --> 10:13.320
Look.

10:13.720 --> 10:16.920
[Happy birthday to you.]

10:17.320 --> 10:20.320
[Happy birthday to you.]

10:21.040 --> 10:21.520
[Make a wish.]

10:21.560 --> 10:22.240
[Okay! Okay! I'm making it.]

10:23.560 --> 10:24.880
[When I turn twenty,]

10:25.080 --> 10:26.320
[I'm gonna be]

10:26.320 --> 10:27.680
[at a top ten school in the world,]

10:27.680 --> 10:29.120
[studying business.]

10:29.600 --> 10:31.560
[And I'm gonna travel the world too.]

10:31.920 --> 10:34.040
[I wanna go to Egypt to see the pyramids,]

10:34.320 --> 10:35.640
[go to Pompeii,]

10:36.080 --> 10:36.880
[and also to Chile]

10:37.160 --> 10:38.840
[to watch a volcano erupt live.]

10:40.360 --> 10:40.920
[Anyway,]

10:41.200 --> 10:42.400
[as long as I want it,]

10:42.800 --> 10:44.640
[the world is at my feet.]

10:46.800 --> 10:48.480
This is who she should be.

10:50.680 --> 10:51.400
This place is just

10:51.400 --> 10:52.520
a temporary safe harbor for her.

10:53.360 --> 10:54.360
Now the wind's picking up.

10:55.120 --> 10:56.360
You need to help her set sail again.

11:02.680 --> 11:03.360
Why do you think

11:03.360 --> 11:04.320
I can talk her into it?

11:06.840 --> 11:08.160
Whether you can or not is one thing,

11:08.560 --> 11:10.120
but your trying is better than not trying.

11:14.520 --> 11:15.120
Xing Wu!

11:17.400 --> 11:18.040
Xing Wu!

11:29.960 --> 11:31.280
[As long as I want it,]

11:31.560 --> 11:33.480
[the world is at my feet.]

11:56.040 --> 11:57.640
How come you two are together?

12:00.320 --> 12:01.120
It's a long story.

12:03.880 --> 12:04.480
Take the fish back.

12:05.160 --> 12:06.000
Use it to butter up my mom.

12:06.240 --> 12:07.080
You can't stay at my place for free.

12:08.360 --> 12:08.920
Fine.

12:09.280 --> 12:10.800
Think about what I said, okay?

12:12.000 --> 12:12.600
What'd you say?

12:13.480 --> 12:14.680
Guy stuff.

12:15.440 --> 12:15.920
I'm out.

12:19.280 --> 12:19.880
Did you eat?

12:25.320 --> 12:26.920
What kind of hairstyle are we doing today?

12:27.600 --> 12:28.680
Give me a perm like this.

12:30.560 --> 12:31.160
Is her hairstyle

12:31.160 --> 12:32.280
the hottest one right now?

12:32.600 --> 12:33.600
Yeah.

12:33.960 --> 12:34.960
Then give me that.

12:35.040 --> 12:35.720
Got it.

12:35.880 --> 12:38.240
Liu Nian's the best at it.

12:38.840 --> 12:40.160
He'll do a great perm for you.

12:40.560 --> 12:41.640
Okay, I promise you'll love it.

12:41.920 --> 12:43.240
Boss lady, can you give me a discount?

12:43.520 --> 12:44.560
Twenty percent off.

12:45.000 --> 12:46.320
You're so generous!

12:47.800 --> 12:49.000
Take good care of her, alright?

12:49.000 --> 12:49.520
You got it.

12:52.160 --> 12:52.640
Auntie.

12:56.800 --> 12:57.520
Call me Aunt.

12:59.640 --> 13:00.080
Aunt.

13:00.200 --> 13:02.120
I was working at the dock this morning,

13:02.120 --> 13:03.000
and I brought you a fish.

13:03.600 --> 13:04.600
Working, huh?

13:06.640 --> 13:07.080
Okay.

13:07.280 --> 13:08.880
Now you're starting to feel like a local.

13:11.600 --> 13:12.720
I was just looking for you.

13:13.120 --> 13:14.160
And here you come.

13:15.440 --> 13:16.160
Give me the fish.

13:20.840 --> 13:21.720
You're an adult, right?

13:27.120 --> 13:27.680
Aunt,

13:27.880 --> 13:29.000
what are you...

13:30.720 --> 13:31.760
Yesterday,

13:31.880 --> 13:33.120
your cake was so sweet.

13:33.120 --> 13:34.160
It completely clouded my judgment.

13:35.600 --> 13:36.880
I didn't realize

13:36.880 --> 13:37.840
you were after Ye.

13:38.920 --> 13:40.200
No, you've got it wrong.

13:40.200 --> 13:41.560
Ye and I are just friends.

13:41.720 --> 13:43.240
I only came to help her.

13:43.840 --> 13:45.000
You city kids,

13:45.360 --> 13:46.240
so smooth

13:46.520 --> 13:47.200
with your words.

13:47.880 --> 13:49.280
I can't outtalk you.

13:50.320 --> 13:51.440
But today,

13:51.880 --> 13:52.720
I asked you to sit here

13:53.160 --> 13:54.280
just to test you.

13:54.880 --> 13:56.440
To see how much you can handle.

13:57.040 --> 13:57.600
Alright.

13:58.000 --> 13:58.520
Aunt.

13:58.800 --> 13:59.680
How do you want to test me?

14:01.920 --> 14:03.080
We have a saying

14:03.160 --> 14:04.280
here.

14:04.640 --> 14:05.680
A man's courage

14:05.840 --> 14:07.240
is as big as

14:07.560 --> 14:08.920
his tolerance for alcohol.

14:13.400 --> 14:13.840
Okay.

14:14.400 --> 14:14.920
Aunt,

14:15.080 --> 14:16.080
I've always been brave,

14:16.520 --> 14:17.680
ever since I was a kid.

14:17.960 --> 14:18.480
Here goes.

14:24.800 --> 14:26.960
Not bad, kid.

14:36.200 --> 14:37.920
Not bad.

14:38.240 --> 14:38.720
Come on,

14:39.160 --> 14:40.240
let's keep drinking then.

14:44.480 --> 14:45.080
Meng!

14:46.720 --> 14:47.280
Are you okay?

14:49.680 --> 14:50.480
Wake up.

14:57.800 --> 14:59.280
What a brave guy.

15:20.040 --> 15:21.440
Meng Ruihang wants me to talk you into

15:22.360 --> 15:23.360
going abroad with him.

15:27.240 --> 15:28.800
Well, he picked the wrong person.

15:30.280 --> 15:30.920
You said

15:31.920 --> 15:32.720
you wouldn't interfere.

15:36.480 --> 15:37.200
Not necessarily.

15:38.800 --> 15:40.000
You want me to go with him?

15:48.120 --> 15:48.880
I think

15:50.160 --> 15:51.440
it'd be good for you to go.

15:58.240 --> 15:58.760
Why?

16:05.280 --> 16:06.080
Do you know the difference

16:07.160 --> 16:08.800
between migratory birds and resident birds?

16:11.440 --> 16:12.360
What are you trying to say?

16:16.040 --> 16:18.200
Resident birds don't migrate with the seasons.

16:19.280 --> 16:20.800
They're born and raised in one place.

16:22.520 --> 16:23.400
But migratory birds are different.

16:24.840 --> 16:26.320
Every winter,

16:26.960 --> 16:27.960
swans from Siberia

16:27.960 --> 16:28.760
fly here

16:29.280 --> 16:30.080
to spend the winter.

16:31.360 --> 16:32.280
Then when it warms up,

16:32.600 --> 16:33.480
and spring comes,

16:34.480 --> 16:35.160
they fly back

16:35.160 --> 16:36.160
to their original home.

16:38.520 --> 16:39.680
So you think I'm a migratory bird?

16:44.360 --> 16:46.000
You should go back to your normal life.

16:46.960 --> 16:48.200
This place isn't right for you.

16:50.480 --> 16:51.560
And it's not worth staying for.

16:56.240 --> 16:57.080
Whether it's worth it or not,

16:57.600 --> 16:58.760
I'll decide for myself.

17:00.280 --> 17:01.360
Don't forget your promise.

17:02.360 --> 17:03.160
If I leave,

17:04.920 --> 17:05.720
make sure you come see me off.

17:15.000 --> 17:15.800
It's a deal.

17:18.440 --> 17:18.920
Okay.

17:37.720 --> 17:39.240
He's way too heavy.

17:40.080 --> 17:40.600
Hey, you.

17:41.120 --> 17:42.360
Lanfang, let's put him down here for a bit.

17:42.360 --> 17:43.080
I can't carry him anymore.

17:43.800 --> 17:44.720
Alright, alright, come on.

17:46.360 --> 17:46.920
Easy.

17:50.760 --> 17:51.480
This kid.

17:52.160 --> 17:53.880
Looked pretty tough,

17:53.960 --> 17:55.120
but turns out he can't hold his liquor at all.

17:56.560 --> 17:57.520
Needs more practice.

18:00.440 --> 18:01.120
What's wrong with him?

18:02.080 --> 18:02.800
Drank too much.

18:03.520 --> 18:04.480
Drank too much?

18:05.280 --> 18:06.840
Who'd he drink with, this early?

18:08.920 --> 18:09.840
Just one bottle.

18:10.160 --> 18:10.640
Actually,

18:10.800 --> 18:12.920
I just wanted to test how much he could drink.

18:14.560 --> 18:16.840
Didn't expect him to be so reckless.

18:16.920 --> 18:18.880
He thought he could hold his liquor, but he couldn't.

18:19.440 --> 18:21.040
Still, you can tell

18:21.520 --> 18:23.360
he really cares about you.

18:25.280 --> 18:26.680
But this recklessness of his,

18:27.040 --> 18:28.680
he's really not as good as our Wu.

18:28.880 --> 18:29.840
I mean, our Wu,

18:30.160 --> 18:30.840
isn't he

18:31.000 --> 18:33.000
steady, reliable, and level-headed?

18:34.280 --> 18:34.920
Anyway,

18:35.960 --> 18:37.440
about going abroad,

18:37.680 --> 18:38.440
I think you should

18:38.440 --> 18:39.600
think it over some more.

18:40.640 --> 18:41.880
Don't worry, Auntie.

18:41.960 --> 18:42.840
I know what I'm doing.

18:44.560 --> 18:45.120
Qing Ye.

18:46.560 --> 18:47.360
I'm gonna take you with me.

18:48.560 --> 18:49.520
I swear. I'm gonna take you.

18:50.680 --> 18:51.840
So devoted.

18:54.120 --> 18:55.120
I can still drink.

18:55.200 --> 18:55.840
What are you drinking for?

18:55.840 --> 18:56.480
Come on, hurry.

18:56.640 --> 18:57.800
I can't carry him anymore.

18:58.120 --> 18:58.760
Quick.

18:58.760 --> 18:59.920
People are passing by.

18:59.920 --> 19:01.360
What if a customer comes?

19:01.440 --> 19:01.840
Wait.

19:02.680 --> 19:03.720
Put him on Wu's bed.

19:04.400 --> 19:05.200
Give me a hand.

19:05.480 --> 19:06.120
Come on.

19:06.960 --> 19:07.600
Come on.

19:21.640 --> 19:22.480
I can still drink.

19:22.760 --> 19:23.800
No more for you.

19:26.040 --> 19:26.960
I'll get him some water.

19:50.320 --> 19:51.360
Can I come in?

19:52.200 --> 19:52.880
Hold on.

19:53.200 --> 19:53.720
I'm coming out.

19:58.440 --> 19:59.680
What's up?

20:40.120 --> 20:40.600
Hello?

20:41.040 --> 20:41.560
Who's this?

20:43.720 --> 20:44.960
[Did Meng Ruihang come looking for you?]

20:47.200 --> 20:48.440
I don't have to answer that.

20:50.920 --> 20:52.000
[Do you know he fell out with his parents]

20:52.000 --> 20:53.480
[because of you?]

22:07.320 --> 22:09.320
Slacking off at work?

22:11.200 --> 22:11.920
Not really your style,

22:11.920 --> 22:13.080
Mr. Workaholic.

22:13.680 --> 22:14.200
What's up?

22:15.000 --> 22:15.920
Just been sitting too long.

22:16.040 --> 22:16.880
Need to get up and move around.

22:18.000 --> 22:19.440
You've been working hard.

22:20.320 --> 22:21.160
I brought you some food.

22:23.120 --> 22:23.680
Thanks.

22:25.520 --> 22:27.360
There's a high wind warning for tonight.

22:27.680 --> 22:29.080
It's too dangerous. You shouldn't go back.

22:29.160 --> 22:30.080
Just stay here.

22:32.640 --> 22:33.120
Alright, fine.

22:36.360 --> 22:37.000
Well,

22:37.560 --> 22:38.720
I heard

22:39.640 --> 22:41.120
that childhood friend of Qing Ye's,

22:41.480 --> 22:42.440
he's trying to take her abroad.

22:46.160 --> 22:46.880
For real?

22:55.000 --> 22:56.480
She was always gonna go abroad.

22:57.320 --> 22:57.920
She's just going back

22:57.920 --> 22:58.920
to her original plan.

23:20.240 --> 23:21.560
Better she leaves

23:22.160 --> 23:22.840
before she gets too attached to this place.

23:46.320 --> 23:46.880
Qing Ye.

23:47.960 --> 23:48.520
Qing Ye.

24:07.000 --> 24:07.680
Where is she?

24:09.760 --> 24:10.360
She left.

24:10.880 --> 24:11.600
Left?

24:12.960 --> 24:13.880
How could she just leave

24:13.880 --> 24:14.880
without saying anything?

24:15.280 --> 24:16.200
With that guy Meng?

24:18.880 --> 24:19.160
Honestly,

24:19.160 --> 24:20.360
I'm still kind of worried

24:20.360 --> 24:21.720
about her being with him.

24:21.960 --> 24:23.040
I mean, they're just two high schoolers.

24:23.320 --> 24:24.720
What if something happens?

24:28.360 --> 24:30.040
You should go back to your normal life.

24:31.040 --> 24:32.040
This place isn't right for you.

24:33.160 --> 24:34.280
And it's not worth staying for.

24:36.080 --> 24:36.920
Whether it's worth it or not,

24:37.480 --> 24:38.560
I'll decide for myself.

24:40.560 --> 24:41.640
Don't forget your promise.

24:44.120 --> 24:44.880
If I leave,

24:46.440 --> 24:47.320
make sure you come see me off.

24:51.120 --> 24:51.680
Wu.

24:56.640 --> 24:57.760
Oh, girl.

25:14.840 --> 25:15.920
You know what this is?

25:19.880 --> 25:20.520
Wheat.

25:22.680 --> 25:23.480
Not wheat.

25:24.560 --> 25:25.480
It's barnyard grass.

25:26.240 --> 25:27.680
A weed that grows in rice fields.

25:29.680 --> 25:30.760
So what's the difference?

25:31.360 --> 25:31.880
Qing Ye,

25:32.200 --> 25:33.040
you don't need to know

25:33.040 --> 25:34.360
the difference between them.

25:34.600 --> 25:35.520
You don't need to know how fishermen

25:35.520 --> 25:36.800
go out and fish.

25:36.800 --> 25:38.480
And you definitely don't need to haul fish.

25:39.160 --> 25:40.600
You were never meant to be here.

25:41.360 --> 25:42.240
Let's go back to Beijing together.

25:42.240 --> 25:43.440
We can live better there.

25:46.440 --> 25:47.280
Will we really?

25:52.480 --> 25:53.760
Actually,

25:54.280 --> 25:55.040
once you know something,

25:55.680 --> 25:57.200
you can't act like you don't.

25:58.520 --> 25:59.360
Like me,

26:00.200 --> 26:02.040
I know how much it hurts to lose family.

26:02.880 --> 26:04.720
So I can't just stand there

26:04.920 --> 26:05.840
and watch you

26:05.840 --> 26:07.040
break away from your family

26:07.520 --> 26:08.720
and still accept your kindness.

26:09.600 --> 26:11.320
So you know everything.

26:12.600 --> 26:13.720
He Leling told me.

26:14.080 --> 26:15.200
She said you had a huge fight with your parents

26:15.200 --> 26:15.920
and ran away.

26:17.000 --> 26:17.520
Qing Ye,

26:17.520 --> 26:19.000
I can fix this.

26:19.280 --> 26:20.040
I know.

26:21.440 --> 26:22.000
Yes,

26:22.480 --> 26:23.680
if I go abroad with you,

26:24.920 --> 26:25.920
maybe it would really start

26:25.920 --> 26:27.000
a whole new life.

26:27.880 --> 26:28.920
But I don't want that.

26:29.280 --> 26:30.680
I still want to make it on my own.

26:30.680 --> 26:31.600
Fight my own battles

26:31.880 --> 26:33.440
and live the life I want.

26:37.760 --> 26:39.200
Just like someone once told me,

26:41.440 --> 26:43.480
You can still be the same as before.

26:44.440 --> 26:45.320
Don't lean on anyone else.

26:46.240 --> 26:47.160
Live proud.

26:51.480 --> 26:52.200
Bus is coming.

26:53.040 --> 26:54.440
When you get to the county town,

26:54.520 --> 26:56.040
just take a taxi to the station.

27:00.960 --> 27:01.720
Who knows when

27:02.400 --> 27:03.480
we'll see each other again.

27:06.280 --> 27:07.480
Text me when you get home.

27:10.080 --> 27:11.280
Still, I'm really worried about you.

27:11.520 --> 27:12.200
Don't be.

27:13.640 --> 27:15.040
I can take care of myself. Anywhere.

27:17.000 --> 27:17.720
Next time,

27:18.400 --> 27:19.200
we'll both be

27:19.520 --> 27:21.000
better than we are now.

27:29.840 --> 27:30.400
Goodbye.

27:30.920 --> 27:31.400
See you.

27:38.240 --> 27:38.800
Qing Ye,

27:39.480 --> 27:40.360
anytime you need me,

27:40.760 --> 27:42.120
just call and I'll come.

28:46.160 --> 28:46.920
You didn't leave?

28:48.840 --> 28:49.520
Where would I go?

28:58.960 --> 28:59.920
So, are you still coming home with me?

29:02.040 --> 29:02.640
Yeah, of course.

29:06.560 --> 29:07.880
But before we go home,

29:08.720 --> 29:10.040
you have to take me somewhere first.

29:11.760 --> 29:12.400
Where?

29:21.600 --> 29:22.760
You wouldn't tell me the whole way here.

29:23.160 --> 29:24.040
What's with the mattress?

29:25.600 --> 29:26.160
You can't keep

29:26.160 --> 29:27.360
sleeping on cardboard.

29:27.640 --> 29:28.480
It's bad for your back.

29:28.720 --> 29:29.960
And I'd feel awful.

29:31.560 --> 29:32.720
Where'd you get the money for a mattress?

29:34.320 --> 29:35.680
I sold some of my clothes online.

29:35.920 --> 29:37.000
Got a pretty good price, actually.

29:37.880 --> 29:38.360
Look.

29:40.520 --> 29:42.200
The only thing is, it's a pain to ship from Zhazhating.

29:42.520 --> 29:44.080
So I went all the way to the county town to mail them.

29:44.320 --> 29:45.600
You brought those all the way from Beijing,

29:45.600 --> 29:46.440
and now you're just selling them?

29:48.840 --> 29:50.200
Look, clothes don't matter.

29:50.440 --> 29:51.880
What matters is you getting a good night's sleep

29:51.880 --> 29:52.720
after working hard all day.

29:53.280 --> 29:54.600
Besides, school starts soon.

29:54.640 --> 29:55.440
Everyone wears uniforms.

29:55.680 --> 29:56.440
I wouldn't even get to wear them.

30:00.440 --> 30:01.040
Thanks.

30:04.840 --> 30:05.840
But I'm curious though.

30:06.800 --> 30:08.440
Who's the big spender?

30:09.320 --> 30:11.160
The site protects people's privacy.

30:11.360 --> 30:12.040
How would I know?

30:12.040 --> 30:12.880
Can't even look it up.

30:13.680 --> 30:14.560
Don't worry.

30:14.680 --> 30:15.840
Those clothes were pretty much new.

30:15.840 --> 30:16.680
I sold them super cheap.

30:16.720 --> 30:17.440
They got a good deal.

30:17.960 --> 30:19.200
I got rid of stuff I don't use.

30:19.640 --> 30:21.160
You get better sleep.

30:21.560 --> 30:22.040
Triple win.

30:24.360 --> 30:24.920
Alright, fine.

30:44.080 --> 30:45.240
This mattress is pretty big.

30:48.600 --> 30:50.720
Not going on that trip with Shu Han,

30:51.680 --> 30:52.480
do you regret it?

30:56.240 --> 30:56.880
No.

31:01.000 --> 31:01.560
Right.

31:02.120 --> 31:03.360
You never wanted to go anyway.

31:07.120 --> 31:07.720
What about you?

31:09.000 --> 31:09.960
Do you regret staying here?

31:10.880 --> 31:11.520
Yeah, I do.

31:17.520 --> 31:18.920
But only for about a second.

31:25.360 --> 31:26.880
So why didn't you go with Meng Ruihang?

31:27.680 --> 31:29.080
Because that's not what I wanted.

31:35.240 --> 31:36.160
Lie down and try it.

31:36.960 --> 31:39.080
This mattress is not just big, it's soft.

31:39.240 --> 31:39.840
Really comfortable.

31:40.040 --> 31:41.120
Go on, try it.

31:51.680 --> 31:52.240
How is it?

31:54.800 --> 31:55.560
I've never

31:55.560 --> 31:57.040
lain down in a car like this before.

31:58.080 --> 31:58.880
It's actually pretty nice.

32:01.680 --> 32:02.640
You know,

32:03.520 --> 32:05.640
all that stuff in Zhazhating,

32:07.280 --> 32:08.840
I never would've imagined any of it.

32:10.360 --> 32:12.160
It was all so exciting

32:12.760 --> 32:13.520
and unforgettable.

32:18.520 --> 32:19.480
So now,

32:20.440 --> 32:21.680
I don't want to leave this place.

32:27.680 --> 32:28.280
Qing Ye,

32:31.520 --> 32:32.680
you stay here.

32:33.840 --> 32:34.960
I won't let you regret it.

32:38.840 --> 32:39.640
What did you say?

32:51.560 --> 32:52.160
I said,

32:55.480 --> 32:56.720
if you stay here too long,

32:58.800 --> 32:59.840
you will regret it.

34:13.440 --> 34:14.800
Are they coming back?

34:15.199 --> 34:16.040
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

34:16.239 --> 34:17.560
Wu just called

34:17.560 --> 34:18.719
and said they're already on their way.

34:32.320 --> 34:32.840
Grandma.

34:32.880 --> 34:33.440
Wu! Wu!

34:33.719 --> 34:34.440
Where's Ye?

34:36.320 --> 34:36.880
Grandma.

34:38.600 --> 34:39.120
You are. You are.

34:39.120 --> 34:40.040
Grandma. Auntie.

34:40.040 --> 34:40.760
Come here, give me a hug.

34:41.480 --> 34:43.520
Why are you all waiting outside?

34:43.639 --> 34:46.040
We were waiting for you to come back.

34:46.040 --> 34:46.639
Yeah.

34:46.639 --> 34:47.800
Wu called earlier

34:47.800 --> 34:49.000
and said you didn't leave.

34:49.239 --> 34:50.320
So we just figured

34:50.320 --> 34:52.040
we'd wait for you out here.

34:52.159 --> 34:53.440
Wait for you to come home for dinner.

34:54.199 --> 34:55.159
See? I told you.

34:55.360 --> 34:57.600
Ye never wanted to leave.

34:58.480 --> 34:59.520
Grandma knows me best.

35:01.160 --> 35:03.200
You scared me to death.

35:03.240 --> 35:04.360
You took that welwitschia

35:04.360 --> 35:05.120
with you.

35:05.120 --> 35:06.520
I really thought you were gone.

35:06.520 --> 35:07.120
No.

35:07.160 --> 35:08.680
That plant is in my room.

35:08.680 --> 35:09.360
You have it?

35:09.360 --> 35:10.960
I didn't even know what that plant was.

35:10.960 --> 35:12.360
So she showed it to me.

35:12.600 --> 35:13.440
Oh, I see.

35:14.360 --> 35:15.480
If I were really leaving,

35:15.480 --> 35:17.040
of course I'd tell you first.

35:17.400 --> 35:18.160
Besides,

35:18.440 --> 35:19.240
I don't want to leave anyway.

35:23.680 --> 35:25.240
Alright. Alright.

35:26.200 --> 35:26.480
Wait.

35:26.480 --> 35:26.920
How did you

35:26.920 --> 35:27.920
come back in this truck?

35:27.920 --> 35:28.320
Right.

35:28.440 --> 35:29.120
There's stuff in the truck.

35:29.440 --> 35:29.840
Yeah.

35:29.960 --> 35:30.520
Liu Nian.

35:31.200 --> 35:31.720
Coming!

35:31.720 --> 35:32.280
Come help.

35:32.840 --> 35:33.360
Easy, easy.

35:33.360 --> 35:33.680
Okay.

35:34.320 --> 35:35.560
Here, you take the back.

35:35.600 --> 35:36.000
Got it.

35:36.680 --> 35:37.520
Why'd you buy

35:37.520 --> 35:38.720
a mattress?

35:39.040 --> 35:40.120
Qing Ye bought it for me.

35:40.600 --> 35:41.120
She insisted.

35:42.960 --> 35:43.880
Mom, you gotta tell her.

35:46.920 --> 35:47.440
Okay, okay.

35:48.240 --> 35:49.080
I insisted.

35:49.360 --> 35:50.160
I spent too much.

35:50.320 --> 35:50.920
Go ahead.

35:54.360 --> 35:55.320
Good buy.

35:57.960 --> 35:59.880
This is from Cici.

35:59.880 --> 36:01.120
Their family just pickled it fresh.

36:01.480 --> 36:02.000
And this is

36:02.000 --> 36:03.640
Zhao Pock's chicken.

36:03.880 --> 36:05.600
And these two dishes, I made them.

36:05.880 --> 36:07.240
Come on, eat up, eat up.

36:07.520 --> 36:08.440
Let me try yours first.

36:08.560 --> 36:09.600
Same here.

36:09.600 --> 36:10.520
I have a feeling mine

36:10.520 --> 36:11.680
tastes pretty good too.

36:11.800 --> 36:12.280
Mmm.

36:12.640 --> 36:14.000
Here, Ye, have some chicken.

36:14.000 --> 36:14.440
Mmm.

36:14.440 --> 36:15.440
So good.

36:16.760 --> 36:17.640
You know what?

36:17.720 --> 36:18.720
Liunian and I were slammed

36:18.720 --> 36:19.920
from morning till night today.

36:20.320 --> 36:21.200
We're gonna pay off the debt

36:21.200 --> 36:22.280
really soon.

36:22.800 --> 36:23.680
No kidding? That's awesome.

36:23.760 --> 36:24.440
I mean it.

36:24.640 --> 36:25.240
Trust me.

36:25.640 --> 36:26.320
We do.

36:26.800 --> 36:28.040
All of us.

36:38.400 --> 36:39.200
The wardrobe.

36:40.760 --> 36:42.120
So you built it for me.

36:43.080 --> 36:44.600
Yeah. Too bad, though.

36:45.000 --> 36:45.480
Your clothes

36:45.480 --> 36:46.840
all got sold online.

36:47.120 --> 36:48.000
There aren't many left.

36:48.680 --> 36:49.440
No big deal.

36:49.960 --> 36:51.600
If it can't hold clothes, I'll put books in it.

36:51.920 --> 36:52.440
Okay.

36:52.920 --> 36:54.040
Whatever you want. It's built already.

36:54.360 --> 36:55.200
You can put anything in there.

36:56.280 --> 36:57.720
School's about to start.

36:57.960 --> 36:58.920
I'm gonna work hard

36:59.280 --> 37:02.200
and try to be the top student in Zhazhating.

37:02.960 --> 37:03.880
I think you can do it.

37:04.280 --> 37:05.120
I think so too.

37:50.720 --> 37:51.440
Qing Ye,

37:53.080 --> 37:54.320
you stay here.

37:55.360 --> 37:56.560
I won't let you regret it.

38:58.360 --> 38:58.880
How is it?

38:59.080 --> 38:59.560
Are you happy?

39:00.600 --> 39:01.640
Of course I am.

39:01.800 --> 39:03.040
Haven't been to an amusement park in ages.

39:03.480 --> 39:05.240
Gotta relax a bit before school starts.

39:05.320 --> 39:05.720
Great.

39:06.480 --> 39:06.960
Let's go.

39:46.360 --> 39:46.920
This is good.

39:53.200 --> 39:53.800
What are you laughing at?

39:53.800 --> 39:54.360
Hold on.

39:55.160 --> 39:55.960
Let me take a picture of you.

39:58.480 --> 39:59.040
See?

40:00.600 --> 40:01.560
You're so bad.

40:26.840 --> 40:27.520
Xing Wu.

40:30.840 --> 40:31.280
Look.

40:31.320 --> 40:31.800
What's up?

40:32.520 --> 40:34.120
A teacher from Anzi County No. 1 High School

40:34.120 --> 40:35.080
just messaged me.

40:35.440 --> 40:37.040
They've finished my enrollment paperwork.

40:37.200 --> 40:38.240
And they want me to go register next week.

40:39.040 --> 40:39.560
That's great.

40:40.280 --> 40:41.160
Do you know that school?

40:42.880 --> 40:43.480
What do you think?

40:46.120 --> 40:47.000
I know it like the back of my hand.

40:47.920 --> 40:48.680
When you go register,

40:48.680 --> 40:49.280
I'll take you there.

41:08.480 --> 41:09.440
Got everything ready?

41:13.040 --> 41:14.560
All the transfer documents are here.

41:16.160 --> 41:17.560
Mr. Sun sent them last week.

41:18.000 --> 41:19.000
So we register today,

41:19.520 --> 41:20.480
and school starts next week.

41:21.040 --> 41:22.880
Then I'll officially be in class.

41:27.360 --> 41:27.920
Qing Ye.

41:30.040 --> 41:30.640
Be honest.

41:31.800 --> 41:32.800
Do you regret staying here

41:33.560 --> 41:34.160
to go to school?

41:34.840 --> 41:35.360
No.

41:39.240 --> 41:40.920
This is the best choice

41:41.160 --> 41:42.280
I can make right now.

41:43.920 --> 41:45.120
Even if it's not perfect,

41:45.560 --> 41:46.160
I'll work hard

41:46.160 --> 41:47.280
to make it perfect.

41:51.160 --> 41:51.680
What?

41:52.600 --> 41:53.200
You don't believe me?

41:54.840 --> 41:55.360
No, I do.

41:57.560 --> 41:59.040
Come on, let's go to school.

42:19.360 --> 42:20.000
Stop here.

42:21.280 --> 42:22.600
You're pretty popular, huh?

42:23.040 --> 42:24.280
Even the security guard doesn't stop you.

42:25.080 --> 42:26.360
I fixed his phone a few times

42:26.680 --> 42:27.360
for free.

42:27.920 --> 42:28.720
So you just love fixing things

42:28.720 --> 42:29.760
for free?

42:30.640 --> 42:32.360
Same with the printer shop owner last time.

42:33.320 --> 42:34.200
Depends on my mood.

42:35.640 --> 42:36.720
Call it building good karma.

42:36.920 --> 42:38.360
Trading it for a friendly face at the gate isn't bad.

42:40.200 --> 42:40.920
This is the building.

42:41.160 --> 42:42.240
Third floor, turn right.

42:42.800 --> 42:43.680
I won't go in with you.

42:44.760 --> 42:45.280
Why not?

42:47.280 --> 42:48.600
The guard doesn't stop me,

42:48.920 --> 42:49.520
but the teachers here

42:49.520 --> 42:50.440
aren't exactly happy to see me.

42:51.480 --> 42:52.200
I'll wait for you right here.

42:53.400 --> 42:54.400
Okay. I'm going.

43:10.360 --> 43:10.880
Come in.

43:13.640 --> 43:14.480
Hello, teacher.

43:14.920 --> 43:16.680
Here are my documents.

43:17.480 --> 43:18.720
Qing Ye, right?

43:18.960 --> 43:20.080
Come on in. Have a seat.

43:20.240 --> 43:20.680
Thank you.

43:20.720 --> 43:21.600
I've been expecting you.

43:26.440 --> 43:27.920
Here's your new uniform.

43:28.480 --> 43:29.440
Thank you, teacher.

43:29.680 --> 43:31.320
The school requires everyone to wear the uniform.

43:31.320 --> 43:32.000
This one's new.

43:32.640 --> 43:33.280
Please sign here.

43:33.440 --> 43:33.960
Okay.

43:40.440 --> 43:41.040
Can we have a chat?
